    "Each choice says what it hears and what leaves your phone. You can change these anytime in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each choice says what it hears and what leaves your phone. You can change these anytime in Settings."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "हर विकल्प बताता है कि वह क्या सुनता है और आपके फ़ोन से क्या बाहर जाता है। आप इन्हें सेटिंग में कभी भी बदल सकते हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each one is asked separately, with the reason first. Saying no never stops setup — but some features will not work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each one is asked separately, with the reason first. Saying no never stops setup — but some features will not work."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "हर अनुमति अलग से, कारण सहित माँगी जाती है। मना करने से सेटअप नहीं रुकता — पर कुछ सुविधाएँ काम नहीं करेंगी।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each phrase needs at least 2 words.": {
