    "Your contacts also got a link to send a cab to you. You confirm the booking inside Uber; Safeguard keeps recording only while it is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your contacts also got a link to send a cab to you. You confirm the booking inside Uber; Safeguard keeps recording only while it is open."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "आपके संपर्कों को भी आपके पास कैब भेजने का लिंक मिला है। बुकिंग की पुष्टि आप Uber के अंदर करते हैं; Safeguard तभी तक रिकॉर्ड करता है जब तक वह खुला है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your contacts will get real Telegram alerts on the next SOS. Only people who pressed Start get them.": {
